From 179f046ab53f7fe214d2602bf63f480dda6ae0d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 00:57:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] plugin: Add metadata support to EventInfo

Introduce PluginRequest to represent plugin requests associated
with logging events.

Extend EventInfo with plugin metadata support, enabling
logging events to carry framework-defined extension data
alongside standard event information.

Plugin metadata is represented as JSON to allow plugin-defined
schemas and future extension mechanisms without requiring
changes to the core event model.

This change introduces the supporting data structures only and
does not alter existing logging behavior.

Change-Id: Ib69585b1d67ad94dccc2554f08d804f683fa275e
Signed-off-by: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
